B.T8=new A.S(B.u,["National Income","Concepts of GDP, GNP, NDP, NNP at Factor Cost and Market Price. Real vs Nominal GDP. Methods of estimation (Value added, Income, Expenditure).",""],t.w)
B.Tq=new A.S(B.u,["Inflation and Business Cycles","Types: Creeping, Galloping, Hyperinflation. Causes: Demand-pull, Cost-push. Measurement: WPI vs CPI. Impact of inflation. Phillips Curve.",""],t.w)
B.Tm=new A.S(B.u,["Money and Banking","Functions of Money. RBI: Functions and Monetary Policy Instruments (Repo, Reverse Repo, CRR, SLR, OMO). Commercial Banks, NPA crisis, Basel Norms, NBFCs.",""],t.w)
B.Tz=new A.S(B.u,["Financial Markets","Money Market (Treasury bills, Call money) vs Capital Market (Shares, Bonds, Debentures). SEBI functions.",""],t.w)
B.SL=new A.S(B.u,["Public Finance & Budgeting","Fiscal Policy. Components of Budget: Revenue and Capital account. Deficits: Fiscal, Revenue, Primary. FRBM Act. Taxation (Direct, Indirect, GST), Finance Commission.",""],t.w)
B.SN=new A.S(B.u,["Balance of Payments (BoP)","Current Account vs Capital Account. Convertibility of Rupee. Foreign Exchange Reserves. Exchange Rate systems (Fixed, Floating, Managed float).",""],t.w)
B.SS=new A.S(B.u,["International Economic Organizations","IMF (SDRs, Quota), World Bank (IBRD, IDA), WTO (Doha Round, Subsidies - Amber/Blue/Green box).",""],t.w)
B.Tv=new A.S(B.u,["Agriculture & Food Security","Cropping patterns, MSP (Minimum Support Price), PDS (Public Distribution System), FCI, Subsidies. Food processing industries.",""],t.w)
