B.T2=new A.S(B.u,["Pollution","Air (PM2.5, PM10, Smog, Acid Rain). Water (BOD, Eutrophication, Biomagnification). Soil, Noise, Radioactive, E-waste. Solid Waste Management Rules.",""],t.w)
